NBT-AAD patch: clean session end (ByeByeRequest / ByeByeResponse), adds AASession::postByeBye().
Used by src/android_auto/aa_video_capture.cpp since 2026-11-10 (car-tested).
Upstream: https://github.com/Sq00ky/Supra-iDrive6-Android-Auto commit 41975f2 (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0).
Apply AFTER scripts/aa_session_overlay.py (aa_session.cpp context is the overlaid file); scripts/build_all.py does both.

